  m_Text: 'There are two types of tournaments:



    1)T20 World Cup -

    A knockout
    tournament where you start from the group stage and move up to the finals. Lose
    once, and you''re knocked out.



    2)ODI World Cup -

    Classic world cup
    tournament where you qualify to the knockout stages by finishing in the top four
    of the league stage.

'
