    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Enjoy the real flavour of cricket with the tried and true Test Match. 
    \n\n\nDECLARATION\n- DECLARE option is available in the Game Pause screen.\r\n-
    Declare matches when you think the score is high enough to win the game.\n\n\nFOLLOW-ON\nFOLLOW-ON
    option appears when the 1st innings score of the team batting second does not
    exceed the score of the team batting first, by a pre-set amount of runs.\n\n\nFollow-on
    preset runs vary according to the overs\r\t\t   \n- For 15 overs - 125 runs\n-
    For 30 overs - 150 runs\n- For 60 overs - 175 runs\n- For 90 overs - 200 runs\r"
