    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "You can upgrade your whole team's batting, bowling and fielding skills
    by purchasing Performance Upgrades.\n\nPerformance Upgrades are of three Skill
    types: Power, Control and Agility.\n\nPower will: \r\n    \t\t\t\t\t* Increase
    power of batting shots\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t* Increase maximum pace of pace bowlers\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t*
    Increase maximum spin by spin bowlers\n\nControl will: \r\n    \t\t\t\t\t* Improve
    batting shot quality\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t* Improve bowling accuracy\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t*
    Improve fielding accuracy\n\nAgility will: \r\n    \t\t\t\t\t* Increase batsmen
    running speed between wickets\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t* Improve fielding skill to stop
    balls\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t* Increase fielder run speed"
