    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Rewarded Videos are optional viewing videos that can help you in different
    ways. \nThe current scenarios where you can watch a Rewarded Video for benefits
    are: \n* To toss again\n* To rebowl every 3rd extra bowled\n* To rebowl ball
    hit for a sixer (once)\n* To try again (once per match) if duck out\n* To Autoplay\n*
    To get back last wicket fallen while chasing (did not hit target)\n* On last
    ball of the match while chasing to face it again (did not hit target)\n* To get
    a free Spin the Wheel\n* Short of coins or need a little extra? Watch videos
    and earn coins."
