  m_Text: "There are two arcade modes: \n\n\n1) Super Over:\nYou have just one over
    to complete a nerve wrecking batting challenge! Every win takes you further till
    you reach the final!! Now get sloggers and your power-hitters geared up!\n\n\n2)
    Super Chase:\nIn this feature you have five levels. You start with 5 overs and
    have to progress to 30 overs by chasing progressively higher targets. Each successful
    chase will unlock the next level."
