    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "There are two arcade modes: \n\n\n1) Super Over:\nSuper Over mode consists
    of one over for each level. The loss of 2 wickets in the over ends your innings.
    You will be provided with a challenge to be completed in every level. Your successful
    completion will allow access to the next level. Beat each challenge to move on
    to subsequent levels and finish all 18 challenges.\n\n\n2) Super Chase:\nIn this
    mode you will be provided with six levels starting from beginner. Each level
    will have 5 set of challenges with increased scores to be chased inside them.
    Beat these 5 match challenges to finish of a level and move on to the next level
    till you master the runs.\nLevels to be faced:\n1. CUB CLASS\n2. YOUNG LION\n3.
    POWER PLAYER\n4. SUPER PRO\n5. CHAMPION\n6. ULTIMATE PRO"
